WEBVTT

01:40.470 --> 01:44.250
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.000 --> 01:47.140
[Episode 7]

01:47.950 --> 01:49.310
Can't we allow mortal beings

01:49.310 --> 01:50.630
and Yuanzhong to see more of

01:50.630 --> 01:51.750
this world?

01:52.910 --> 01:54.270
No wonder Deity Shangshan

01:54.270 --> 01:55.750
wanted to set rules with you.

01:55.750 --> 01:56.950
You've become emotional

01:57.590 --> 01:59.310
and lost your rationality.

01:59.479 --> 02:00.310
You're the one who has

02:00.310 --> 02:01.630
become emotional and irrational,

02:01.630 --> 02:02.510
not me.

02:04.430 --> 02:05.430
Hannv,

02:05.590 --> 02:07.150
I know you're an incense deity

02:07.310 --> 02:08.669
with many eyes and ears in the mortal realm.

02:08.669 --> 02:10.430
You must know what's about to happen.

02:10.430 --> 02:12.110
Yuanzhong must be in danger,

02:12.150 --> 02:13.680
that's why you're trying to stop me from going back.

02:13.830 --> 02:14.670
But it won't work.

02:15.150 --> 02:16.230
You can't stop me.

03:05.710 --> 03:06.790
I have something to say.

03:06.870 --> 03:07.750
Baili Xiang.

03:08.070 --> 03:09.350
What's gotten into you now?

03:09.510 --> 03:10.780
Can't whatever you have to say wait

03:10.800 --> 03:12.110
until after the seal is removed?

03:12.110 --> 03:13.590
If we wait until the seal is removed,

03:14.270 --> 03:15.990
it will be too late.

03:21.120 --> 03:22.000
High Priest,

03:22.360 --> 03:23.920
you said before that in the battle of Pinghu,

03:23.950 --> 03:25.110
the War Demon Clan

03:25.110 --> 03:26.870
had all died by your hand.

03:27.030 --> 03:28.070
Is that true or not?

03:28.230 --> 03:29.020
Yes,

03:29.390 --> 03:30.470
I did say that.

03:30.590 --> 03:32.590
But I think I was too arrogant.

03:32.630 --> 03:33.829
There might have been a few

03:33.829 --> 03:34.870
who escaped.

03:35.180 --> 03:36.190
It's not impossible.

03:37.350 --> 03:39.350
High Priest, you're being so modest.

03:39.550 --> 03:40.350
I suppose these years

03:40.350 --> 03:41.800
of spiritual cultivation at Tianqu Peak

03:41.800 --> 03:43.470
have been very beneficial to you.

03:43.710 --> 03:45.270
The power of the Divine Left Hand

03:45.270 --> 03:46.470
is evident to everyone.

03:46.510 --> 03:47.910
Since you said that

03:48.230 --> 03:50.130
they were all killed,

03:50.310 --> 03:51.790
then they must have been killed.

03:51.950 --> 03:53.870
But if they all died,

03:53.870 --> 03:54.829
then how do you explain

03:54.829 --> 03:56.190
these possessions?

03:56.950 --> 03:58.790
I've been puzzled about this too.

03:58.790 --> 04:00.630
So recently, I secretly

04:00.630 --> 04:02.230
conducted a small investigation.

04:20.870 --> 04:22.550
Greetings, High Priest.

04:23.390 --> 04:24.430
Who are they?

04:24.580 --> 04:25.600
[Madam Zhuo and Madam Lanshan of Youhu Clan]

04:24.990 --> 04:25.870
Senior Cheng,

04:25.990 --> 04:27.110
you're fond of drinking

04:27.110 --> 04:28.310
and are still unmarried,

04:28.310 --> 04:29.670
so naturally you wouldn't know them.

04:29.990 --> 04:31.110
Elder Xinyao,

04:31.270 --> 04:33.540
this is Madam Zhuo, our clan's medical woman.

04:33.540 --> 04:34.420
Years ago,

04:34.420 --> 04:35.990
she studied medicine under you.

04:35.990 --> 04:37.070
Do you remember?

04:37.590 --> 04:39.230
She did indeed study under me,

04:39.390 --> 04:40.590
specializing in women's medicine.

04:40.790 --> 04:42.430
Elder Xinyao's medical skills are excellent,

04:42.430 --> 04:43.750
so the disciples she trains

04:43.750 --> 04:45.230
are naturally skilled as well.

04:45.230 --> 04:45.990
So in recent years,

04:45.990 --> 04:47.510
most of our clan's newborns

04:47.510 --> 04:49.110
have been delivered by her.

04:49.390 --> 04:51.440
This includes

04:52.030 --> 04:55.080
Generals Chiyi and Xiazhi.

04:56.710 --> 04:57.590
Madam Zhuo,

04:57.790 --> 04:58.750
tell us,

04:58.909 --> 04:59.950
when was General Chiyi

04:59.950 --> 05:02.870
born? On what year, month, and day?

05:02.870 --> 05:03.550
Yes.

05:04.350 --> 05:06.430
It's been too long.

05:06.550 --> 05:09.600
Besides, there was the war against the War Demon Clan.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.270
To protect them against the possessing techniques,

05:11.360 --> 05:12.710
the Council of Elders destroyed

05:12.710 --> 05:15.260
all the birth records of the clan members.

05:15.430 --> 05:17.190
There are no records left to check.

05:18.070 --> 05:20.160
But when Elder Baili came to inquire,

05:20.190 --> 05:21.270
I went back to search through

05:21.270 --> 05:22.430
my personal notes.

05:22.910 --> 05:24.790
And I actually found something.

05:25.110 --> 05:26.630
General Chiyi's mother

05:26.630 --> 05:28.390
was a winemaker at Penglai Pavilion.

05:28.390 --> 05:30.030
She was also an acquaintance of mine.

05:30.950 --> 05:32.630
On the day she gave birth,

05:32.630 --> 05:35.310
it happened to be the day when new rice was ripe.

05:35.350 --> 05:37.630
That day, she was working in the workshop

05:37.630 --> 05:38.710
when she suddenly felt abdominal pain.

05:38.710 --> 05:40.070
So she called for me.

05:40.550 --> 05:43.150
On my way there, I passed through the rice fields.

05:43.790 --> 05:45.470
I saw the rice ears swaying,

05:45.630 --> 05:46.909
spreading gold across the ground.

05:46.950 --> 05:48.150
It was a beautiful sight.

05:48.510 --> 05:49.510
So when I returned,

05:49.510 --> 05:51.500
I wrote it down in my notes.

05:51.870 --> 05:52.670
So you're saying

05:53.350 --> 05:54.950
General Chiyi's birthday

05:55.230 --> 05:56.670
was in autumn?

05:56.750 --> 05:57.510
Yes.

05:57.790 --> 05:59.110
That's strange.

05:59.150 --> 06:00.990
General Chiyi was killed by possession

06:00.990 --> 06:02.270
on March 19th.

06:02.550 --> 06:05.550
But his birthday was in autumn.

06:05.830 --> 06:07.590
Does everyone think this makes sense?

06:07.590 --> 06:09.060
Even she herself said

06:09.190 --> 06:10.470
it was a long time ago,

06:10.950 --> 06:12.750
so maybe she remembered it wrong.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.190
I was also afraid she might have remembered incorrectly,

06:14.510 --> 06:16.990
so I asked someone else.

06:18.310 --> 06:20.700
This elderly lady is from the Peng clan of Lanshan.

06:20.700 --> 06:22.020
She's the current head of the family,

06:22.050 --> 06:23.370
Madam Lanshan.

06:23.910 --> 06:24.980
Grand Elder,

06:26.030 --> 06:27.430
and all the Elders,

06:28.830 --> 06:31.570
I am Xiazhi's grandmother.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.470
Although it's not our clan's custom

06:34.470 --> 06:36.590
to celebrate birthdays,

06:37.060 --> 06:38.720
I still remember

06:38.720 --> 06:40.510
which day my own grandson

06:41.360 --> 06:43.390
was born.

06:44.310 --> 06:46.670
Xiazhi was born on

06:47.230 --> 06:49.520
the 6th of November.

06:50.230 --> 06:52.270
The day before he was killed,

06:52.510 --> 06:54.390
he came back to visit me.

06:55.150 --> 06:57.180
He served me tea,

06:57.880 --> 07:00.230
burned incense, and washed clothes.

07:01.070 --> 07:02.070
Before he left,

07:02.070 --> 07:03.590
he knelt before me

07:03.590 --> 07:06.030
and kowtowed three times,

07:06.420 --> 07:10.070
saying he was grateful for my nurturing grace.

07:10.820 --> 07:12.670
I was puzzled before,

07:12.790 --> 07:14.600
but now I realize

07:14.830 --> 07:17.590
he knew his time had come,

07:17.910 --> 07:18.780
and he came back

07:20.190 --> 07:22.230
to bid me farewell.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.610
Madam, please accept my condolences.

07:33.830 --> 07:34.990
Mr. Tanghua,

07:35.010 --> 07:36.610
do you have anything to say?

07:37.590 --> 07:39.150
I have nothing to say.

07:39.190 --> 07:40.390
Then if I say that

07:41.230 --> 07:43.590
the possession was actually fabricated,

07:44.180 --> 07:45.970
and someone was behind it,

07:46.909 --> 07:47.710
do you

07:48.450 --> 07:50.090
still have nothing to say?

07:50.750 --> 07:51.550
Baili,

07:51.830 --> 07:53.670
this is a serious matter. You mustn't speak recklessly.

07:53.670 --> 07:55.190
Of course I'm not speaking recklessly.

07:57.540 --> 07:58.430
The evil art of possession

07:58.430 --> 08:00.070
is a secret technique of the War Demon clan.

08:00.390 --> 08:01.350
Although I don't know

08:01.350 --> 08:02.830
the specific method of performing it,

08:02.860 --> 08:04.060
those who have been possessed

08:04.060 --> 08:05.390
have three characteristics.

08:06.070 --> 08:06.870
First,

08:07.510 --> 08:09.190
they are unable to control themselves, behaving irrationally

08:09.190 --> 08:10.800
as if possessed by a foreign entity.

08:10.910 --> 08:11.700
Second,

08:11.910 --> 08:13.750
the multiple spiritual energies within the body result in chaos

08:13.750 --> 08:15.350
and a risk of dying from the body exploding.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.230
Third,

08:16.910 --> 08:19.060
spells will cover their entire body.

08:19.310 --> 08:20.790
The first two characteristics can be faked if one is

08:20.790 --> 08:21.670
willing to risk their life,

08:21.670 --> 08:23.120
but the third characteristic

08:23.340 --> 08:25.110
requires some special techniques.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.510
This insect is called Tiankui.

08:42.909 --> 08:44.230
Due to its small and weak nature,

08:44.270 --> 08:46.180
it naturally possesses the ability to conceal itself.

08:46.180 --> 08:47.390
Only under spiritual energy

08:47.390 --> 08:48.510
will it become visible.

08:48.510 --> 08:49.310
If we use this insect's

08:49.310 --> 08:50.630
secreted fluid as ink

08:50.630 --> 08:52.390
to write spells all over the body,

08:52.430 --> 08:53.710
it's normally invisible.

08:53.710 --> 08:55.070
But as soon as one uses their spiritual power,

08:55.070 --> 08:56.310
the spells immediately appear,

08:56.710 --> 08:59.830
making it look like a possession.

09:04.910 --> 09:06.030
Mr. Tanghua,

09:06.360 --> 09:07.630
the fluid of this Tiankui insect,

09:07.630 --> 09:08.690
when applied to the body,

09:08.720 --> 09:10.920
will only disappear on its own after 10 days.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.630
As 10 days haven't passed yet,

09:12.970 --> 09:15.570
whether it's real or fake,

09:16.590 --> 09:18.240
we'll know with one test.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.430
You still dare to deny it?

09:29.470 --> 09:30.630
You're treacherous and cunning.

09:30.630 --> 09:32.310
How do I know if you're not planning to harm me?

09:32.350 --> 09:33.670
Why should I surrender

09:33.670 --> 09:34.670
and let you do as you please?

09:40.690 --> 09:41.410
Stop!

10:05.590 --> 10:06.710
Let me down quickly!

10:06.730 --> 10:07.940
You crazy old woman!

10:18.460 --> 10:19.140
Get away!

10:19.160 --> 10:19.830
Don't move.

10:19.870 --> 10:20.790
It stinks!

10:20.790 --> 10:21.840
-Don’t touch me!
-Don't move.

10:22.310 --> 10:23.350
Don't move.

10:24.350 --> 10:25.030
It'll be done soon.

10:25.030 --> 10:25.910
What are you drawing?

10:26.190 --> 10:27.120
What is this thing?

10:28.150 --> 10:29.400
It'll be done soon.

10:30.150 --> 10:31.230
What is this thing?

10:31.470 --> 10:32.550
Crazy old woman!

10:34.390 --> 10:35.510
-It’s done.
-What did you do?

10:36.030 --> 10:36.990
What did you do?

10:36.990 --> 10:37.990
Beautiful.

10:38.310 --> 10:39.270
What did you do?

10:42.030 --> 10:42.990
Don't go!

10:44.180 --> 10:45.220
Let me down!

10:46.110 --> 10:46.900
Tanghua!

10:47.310 --> 10:48.270
It really is you.

10:48.430 --> 10:50.550
Tanghua, how dare you?

10:51.130 --> 10:52.610
So what if it's me?

10:52.950 --> 10:53.750
Tanghua,

10:54.590 --> 10:56.510
you've disappointed me greatly.

10:56.910 --> 10:57.710
Tell me,

10:58.070 --> 11:00.870
is this entirely your doing,

11:01.190 --> 11:02.740
or is someone else behind this?

11:02.740 --> 11:04.390
One bears the consequences of one's own actions.

11:04.550 --> 11:06.510
Everything was done by me alone.

11:06.630 --> 11:07.670
Chiyi and Xiazhi

11:07.670 --> 11:09.310
were merely deceived by me.

11:09.830 --> 11:11.470
Why did you do this?

11:11.790 --> 11:12.790
Why?

11:14.990 --> 11:15.870
Why?

11:15.870 --> 11:17.230
You ask me why?

11:17.550 --> 11:18.350
Lord Wenying,

11:19.220 --> 11:21.100
you were once the deputy commander of the secret division.

11:21.710 --> 11:23.030
In the battle of Xiangma Pass,

11:23.790 --> 11:25.070
Without the High Priest,

11:25.190 --> 11:25.990
would you still be alive

11:25.990 --> 11:27.310
to speak so shamelessly here?

11:27.900 --> 11:28.780
Your son, Shuofeng,

11:28.800 --> 11:30.080
was kidnapped by the War Demon.

11:30.470 --> 11:32.310
It was High Priest who attempted three rescues,

11:32.310 --> 11:33.750
cutting through the camp of the War Demons

11:33.750 --> 11:35.150
to save him.

11:35.550 --> 11:36.350
How come

11:36.350 --> 11:37.710
after only 60 years,

11:37.870 --> 11:39.190
you've become so forgetful?

11:39.350 --> 11:40.750
Have you forgotten everything?

11:41.300 --> 11:42.150
And you,

11:42.480 --> 11:43.870
when Bianshui was surrounded,

11:44.270 --> 11:45.630
High Priest alone covered the retreat,

11:45.630 --> 11:46.440
saving the entire army

11:46.440 --> 11:48.200
and everyone's lives.

11:48.620 --> 11:49.910
What did you all say then?

11:50.470 --> 11:53.020
"We'll honor him as our master and serve him for life."

11:54.250 --> 11:55.430
And now, you don't remember

11:55.430 --> 11:56.510
a single word?

11:59.270 --> 12:00.960
I know why you're like this.

12:01.310 --> 12:02.070
Your wife

12:02.070 --> 12:03.550
died in the battle of Pinghu.

12:03.670 --> 12:05.270
You've always held a grudge,

12:06.190 --> 12:07.310
thinking it was the High Priest

12:07.310 --> 12:08.710
who failed to protect her.

12:09.070 --> 12:10.320
But that was an accident.

12:10.630 --> 12:11.910
Even gods can make mistakes.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.310
Why can't he?

12:14.590 --> 12:15.670
You people

12:16.240 --> 12:18.520
are ungrateful and disloyal!

12:18.790 --> 12:20.110
How dare you reside on Fangwai Mountain

12:20.110 --> 12:21.470
and receive offerings from thousands?

12:21.550 --> 12:22.350
Enough!

12:23.080 --> 12:23.870
Tanghua.

12:25.260 --> 12:26.140
Tell me,

12:26.670 --> 12:29.910
was the possession your doing?

12:30.230 --> 12:31.070
Indeed it was.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.190
Very well.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.910
As a general of the War Division,

12:33.910 --> 12:35.150
you knowingly broke the law.

12:35.230 --> 12:36.830
I have no choice but to deal with you.

12:37.110 --> 12:38.270
As for any grievances

12:38.270 --> 12:39.030
or resentments you may have,

12:39.230 --> 12:41.030
we'll discuss them at the Law Enforcement Hall.

12:41.190 --> 12:42.000
Guards!

12:43.070 --> 12:43.870
Yes, sir!

12:44.200 --> 12:45.470
Take Tanghua away.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.230
Yes, sir.

12:46.350 --> 12:47.150
Wait.

12:53.830 --> 12:55.070
Are you going to punish him?

12:55.910 --> 12:57.230
He committed a serious crime.

12:57.230 --> 12:59.510
Without punishment, we can't appease the dead.

12:59.830 --> 13:00.630
Then,

13:01.390 --> 13:02.630
I want to take his punishment.

13:02.630 --> 13:03.110
Is that possible?

13:03.110 --> 13:03.910
No, it's not.

13:04.780 --> 13:06.720
High Priest, what did you say?

13:07.590 --> 13:08.390
I said,

13:08.870 --> 13:10.430
I want to take his punishment.

13:10.430 --> 13:12.390
You want to take his punishment.

13:12.750 --> 13:13.630
Is that really true?

13:15.190 --> 13:16.030
After all,

13:16.550 --> 13:18.580
this all started because of me.

13:18.620 --> 13:20.750
Tanghua committed this grave mistake

13:20.950 --> 13:22.510
because of me.

13:22.860 --> 13:24.230
As the High Priest,

13:24.510 --> 13:26.790
and someone aspiring to become a god,

13:26.870 --> 13:28.460
I should take responsibility for this.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.550
You'll take his punishment?

13:32.950 --> 13:34.270
That sounds so noble.

13:34.710 --> 13:35.990
In fact, you've known all along.

13:35.990 --> 13:37.590
You're the one who did this,

13:37.590 --> 13:38.340
aren't you?

13:41.150 --> 13:42.230
Your physical body isn't here.

13:42.230 --> 13:44.030
With just your spirit, you're no match for me.

13:44.160 --> 13:45.600
Tanyin, I don't want to hurt you.

13:45.710 --> 13:46.750
But Taihe is in imminent danger.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.950
I can't wait any longer.

13:47.990 --> 13:49.030
Stay here for now.

13:49.030 --> 13:50.000
Once we have a result,

13:50.000 --> 13:51.190
I'll naturally let you go.

13:51.190 --> 13:52.830
Forgive me, Hannv.

13:53.990 --> 13:54.640
Drought Dragon!

14:06.630 --> 14:07.470
Stop her!

14:52.670 --> 14:53.630
I don't understand what you're

14:53.630 --> 14:54.630
talking about.

14:54.980 --> 14:57.230
Stop pretending.

14:57.590 --> 14:58.670
If my guess is correct,

14:58.670 --> 15:01.150
you knew everything about the fake possession.

15:01.430 --> 15:02.550
You took advantage of the situation

15:02.550 --> 15:04.310
and tricked Tanghua and others to their deaths.

15:04.310 --> 15:05.780
You just wanted us to believe

15:05.780 --> 15:07.540
that the War Demons had returned

15:07.670 --> 15:09.670
to scare those fools

15:10.110 --> 15:11.550
into voluntarily removing

15:11.550 --> 15:12.870
the golden hoop from your neck.

15:13.030 --> 15:14.190
Am I right?

15:15.510 --> 15:17.390
It's quite a clever scheme.

15:17.470 --> 15:19.070
Too bad you can fool them,

15:19.070 --> 15:20.340
but you can't fool me.

15:21.870 --> 15:22.990
I'll say it again,

15:23.350 --> 15:25.230
I don't understand what you're talking about.

15:25.390 --> 15:26.190
Fine.

15:27.550 --> 15:28.470
You don't understand.

15:28.630 --> 15:29.430
Alright.

15:30.070 --> 15:31.710
Then take your time to figure it out.

15:32.470 --> 15:34.430
Take Tanghua, the traitor, away.

15:35.070 --> 15:35.870
Let go!

15:36.260 --> 15:37.190
I know.

15:37.230 --> 15:38.430
High Priest, you want to

15:38.430 --> 15:39.830
take the punishment for Tanghua

15:39.830 --> 15:41.190
to share the guilt.

15:41.350 --> 15:42.300
But that's not possible.

15:42.740 --> 15:44.910
Because you're also suspected

15:44.910 --> 15:46.190
of being involved in the rebellion.

15:48.600 --> 15:50.360
Grand Elder, what makes you say that?

15:50.360 --> 15:51.630
Am I wrong?

15:51.650 --> 15:53.690
You've practiced for years without progress.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.550
Seeing no hope of becoming a god,

15:55.570 --> 15:57.530
you want to remove the golden hoop, right?

15:57.870 --> 15:59.140
But if you don't want to become a god,

15:59.140 --> 16:00.270
just say it outright.

16:00.270 --> 16:02.030
We can't force you, can we?

16:02.240 --> 16:03.470
How could you commit such a bloodshed

16:03.470 --> 16:04.670
and take their lives?

16:04.790 --> 16:05.830
You're talking nonsense!

16:06.750 --> 16:07.790
It seems

16:07.830 --> 16:09.550
your mind is indeed not firm.

16:09.550 --> 16:10.140
This is why

16:10.140 --> 16:11.790
you can't ascend.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.310
High Priest,

16:13.830 --> 16:15.710
considering your years of service,

16:15.710 --> 16:17.200
I can overlook

16:17.200 --> 16:18.830
your fault of indulgence and instigation.

16:19.110 --> 16:20.990
But Chiyi and Xiazhi

16:20.990 --> 16:22.150
cannot die in vain.

16:22.230 --> 16:23.110
From today,

16:23.630 --> 16:25.230
the High Priest will be imprisoned

16:25.230 --> 16:27.270
in the secret chamber inside Tianqu Peak

16:27.270 --> 16:28.510
to reflect in seclusion.

16:28.510 --> 16:30.790
Dingxu! Don't use this as an excuse.

16:30.870 --> 16:32.260
All of this was done by me alone.

16:32.260 --> 16:33.390
It has nothing to do with Yuanzhong.

16:33.470 --> 16:35.070
If you want to blame someone, blame only me!

16:37.590 --> 16:38.440
High Priest,

16:39.030 --> 16:40.310
do you have any objections?

16:46.230 --> 16:47.030
No,

16:47.750 --> 16:49.030
I'm just a bit worried.

16:51.110 --> 16:52.230
Worried about what?

16:54.910 --> 16:56.300
Are you really sure

16:57.070 --> 16:58.620
that all the War Demons are dead?

16:59.460 --> 17:00.350
Help!

17:00.350 --> 17:01.110
Don't move.

17:01.950 --> 17:03.390
As long as you don't move,

17:03.590 --> 17:05.150
I'll just take a little blood

17:05.510 --> 17:06.790
to perform a spell.

17:07.630 --> 17:09.470
My aim is precise,

17:10.390 --> 17:11.910
you won't die.

17:13.790 --> 17:15.349
If they're not dead,

17:16.069 --> 17:17.990
will you come begging for my help again?

17:19.560 --> 17:22.589
Will I agree then?

17:23.190 --> 17:25.069
I'm afraid you'll have to

17:25.069 --> 17:26.869
all kneel and kowtow to me

17:29.570 --> 17:31.270
for me to consider it.

17:31.500 --> 17:33.340
Hatred is also an obsession.

17:33.840 --> 17:36.970
High Priest, you've broken your vows again.

17:38.410 --> 17:40.210
The Youhu Clan has tens of thousands of folks.

17:40.220 --> 17:41.780
Everyone cultivates immortality and seeks the Way.

17:41.870 --> 17:43.110
The War Division has thousands of generals.

17:43.110 --> 17:44.310
Their fighting power is extraordinary.

17:44.350 --> 17:46.270
There has never been anyone in this world

17:46.270 --> 17:47.990
who can't survive without someone else.

17:48.310 --> 17:49.310
Besides, the War Demons have

17:49.310 --> 17:50.230
long since died out.

17:50.230 --> 17:51.750
Didn't you say those words

17:51.770 --> 17:52.850
yourself?

17:56.550 --> 17:57.550
I said it.

17:59.430 --> 18:00.230
Sheng Xiang.

18:00.520 --> 18:01.170
Yes.

18:01.260 --> 18:03.310
Escort High Priest to Tianqu Peak.

18:03.390 --> 18:04.550
Assign extra guards to watch over him.

18:04.550 --> 18:05.470
There must be no mishaps.

18:05.750 --> 18:06.540
Understood.

18:07.830 --> 18:09.640
Take good care of the High Priest.

18:09.910 --> 18:11.030
You must...

18:14.710 --> 18:15.480
Where was I?

18:15.480 --> 18:16.230
Dingxu?

18:17.310 --> 18:17.870
Dingxu!

18:17.870 --> 18:18.540
My head...

18:19.310 --> 18:20.150
What's wrong?

18:20.150 --> 18:20.950
Grand Elder.

18:21.030 --> 18:21.830
Dingxu.

18:22.330 --> 18:23.120
My head hurts.

18:26.790 --> 18:28.420
The Ghost Ancestor of Yin, the Lord of the Tombs.

18:28.420 --> 18:30.350
With the blood of battles, I drive the spirits of war.

18:30.440 --> 18:32.030
I forsake my body, capture my soul.

18:32.030 --> 18:34.110
Sever my hatred, slaughter my enemies.

18:34.790 --> 18:36.470
The Ghost Ancestor of Yin, the Lord of the Tombs.

18:36.470 --> 18:38.390
With the blood of battles, I drive the spirits of war.

18:38.390 --> 18:40.150
I forsake my body, capture my soul.

18:40.150 --> 18:42.430
Sever my hatred, slaughter my enemies.

18:42.790 --> 18:44.470
The Ghost Ancestor of Yin, the Lord of the Tombs.

18:44.470 --> 18:46.510
With the blood of battles, I drive the spirits of war.

18:46.510 --> 18:48.310
I forsake my body, capture my soul.

18:48.310 --> 18:50.350
Sever my hatred, slaughter my enemies.

18:56.430 --> 18:57.720
This... This is...

18:58.100 --> 18:59.010
It's the possession.

19:02.670 --> 19:03.470
Grand Elder.

19:04.630 --> 19:05.420
Grand Elder.

19:09.260 --> 19:10.580
Dingxu, you bastard.

19:11.390 --> 19:13.390
I'll kill you with my own hands today,

19:13.980 --> 19:15.790
to avenge my late husband.

19:16.790 --> 19:17.590
Stop!

19:20.680 --> 19:21.930
Zi Fei, save him!

19:58.150 --> 19:59.630
Since you're seeking death,

20:00.350 --> 20:02.390
I'll kill you all first.

20:08.990 --> 20:10.310
Little Yuanzhong,

20:11.230 --> 20:12.300
it's you.

20:12.740 --> 20:13.790
Who are you?

20:14.030 --> 20:14.830
Me?

20:16.110 --> 20:17.310
I am Granny Gu.

20:17.870 --> 20:18.980
I've never heard of you.

20:18.980 --> 20:20.270
You've never heard of me?

20:20.270 --> 20:21.670
You've never heard of me?

20:21.670 --> 20:22.880
You all killed my husband

20:22.880 --> 20:24.200
and my son.

20:25.230 --> 20:26.400
You're a War Demon?

20:26.430 --> 20:27.310
Of course.

20:27.950 --> 20:29.230
I am a War Demon.

20:29.350 --> 20:30.620
We are the divine race.

20:30.950 --> 20:32.430
You bunch of ants,

20:32.750 --> 20:34.070
I'll kill you all.

20:38.150 --> 20:38.950
Yuanzhong.

20:45.590 --> 20:46.390
Ji Tanyin.

20:46.710 --> 20:47.500
Ji Tanyin.

20:50.190 --> 20:50.990
Qian Lin.

20:52.270 --> 20:53.110
Don't worry about me now.

20:53.110 --> 20:54.070
Stop her quickly!

20:54.350 --> 20:56.020
The Ghost Ancestor of Yin, the Lord of the Tombs.

20:56.110 --> 20:57.710
I'm going to slaughter you all.

21:08.110 --> 21:08.910
Ji Tanyin.

21:09.030 --> 21:09.830
Ji Tanyin.

21:12.430 --> 21:13.510
Who allowed you to come here?

21:14.350 --> 21:15.190
Luckily...

21:16.390 --> 21:17.310
What did you say?

21:17.830 --> 21:19.620
Luckily I made it in time.

21:27.030 --> 21:27.820
Ji Tanyin.

21:28.230 --> 21:29.030
Ji Tanyin.

21:42.200 --> 21:42.910
Kneel.

21:42.930 --> 21:43.740
Kneel.

21:45.030 --> 21:45.830
Clan Leader.

21:50.370 --> 21:51.610
All of you, leave first.

21:53.510 --> 21:54.310
Let's go.

21:58.270 --> 21:59.880
A little bit more.

22:01.220 --> 22:03.300
I was so close!

22:11.320 --> 22:14.040
[Chief of the Demon Clan, Li Chaoyang]

22:13.670 --> 22:15.710
You performed the possessing technique?

22:18.270 --> 22:19.070
Yes.

22:19.550 --> 22:20.350
On whom?

22:21.080 --> 22:23.050
Someone from the Youhu Clan.

22:23.750 --> 22:25.350
His name is Dingxu.

22:25.830 --> 22:27.030
Do you know him?

22:27.470 --> 22:28.630
Are you aware that

22:29.230 --> 22:31.400
exposing our clan's existence without permission

22:31.630 --> 22:33.980
is a sin that will get your heart crushed and tongue ripped out?

22:34.140 --> 22:36.690
I was so close!

22:37.510 --> 22:38.990
How did you manage to do it?

22:40.910 --> 22:43.430
It is the guidance from god.

22:43.630 --> 22:44.870
She told me

22:45.030 --> 22:47.930
she would help me seek revenge.

22:48.790 --> 22:49.590
Clan Leader,

22:49.950 --> 22:51.270
this old woman has gone mad.

22:53.630 --> 22:54.870
You don't trust me?

22:55.510 --> 22:57.310
I'll find it and show you.

22:57.940 --> 22:59.090
Send someone to keep an eye on her.

22:59.270 --> 23:00.050
Yes.

23:04.330 --> 23:05.340
Found it.

23:05.670 --> 23:06.590
Found it.

23:07.390 --> 23:08.590
It's here.

23:10.400 --> 23:12.350
This is our god.

23:19.590 --> 23:20.390
Oh, dear god.

23:21.880 --> 23:22.870
Reveal your presence.

23:24.550 --> 23:25.590
Reveal your presence.

23:26.500 --> 23:27.350
[Demon Clan, Shiren]

23:28.190 --> 23:29.430
The god has revealed their presence!

23:29.830 --> 23:31.190
The god has revealed their presence!

23:32.750 --> 23:34.200
The god has revealed their presence!

23:35.270 --> 23:36.590
Why did the godly light disappear?

23:36.710 --> 23:37.820
This often happens.

23:38.260 --> 23:40.230
Oh god, please reveal your presence quickly.

23:40.660 --> 23:41.770
Reveal your presence quickly.

23:41.870 --> 23:43.030
From now on,

23:43.050 --> 23:44.290
watch over this shrine carefully.

23:44.510 --> 23:46.210
I've always done so.

23:46.640 --> 23:47.470
You stay.

23:47.670 --> 23:49.350
Report immediately if there is any unusual activity.

23:49.370 --> 23:50.160
Clan Leader,

23:50.310 --> 23:51.790
this old woman is just a lunatic.

23:51.790 --> 23:52.710
Why would you take her words

23:52.710 --> 23:53.590
to heart?

23:53.870 --> 23:54.670
No.

23:55.080 --> 23:56.010
When I was young,

23:56.350 --> 23:58.350
I saw my father conversing with the god.

23:59.270 --> 24:00.110
I know

24:00.610 --> 24:02.290
the god has always been here.

24:24.430 --> 24:25.390
Elder Xinyao,

24:26.020 --> 24:28.190
we all have been kneeling here for a long time.

24:28.670 --> 24:29.670
I wonder what the High Priest

24:29.670 --> 24:30.660
is having in mind.

24:31.350 --> 24:33.750
How about you go in and sound him out?

24:34.870 --> 24:36.630
If you really can't be patient,

24:36.920 --> 24:38.470
you might as well go in yourself and ask.

25:06.350 --> 25:07.740
Xinyao and the Council of Elders

25:07.740 --> 25:09.060
have been kneeling outside the whole night.

25:10.150 --> 25:11.390
Tanghua has been locked up.

25:11.390 --> 25:12.270
The War Division is leaderless

25:12.270 --> 25:13.230
and in complete chaos.

25:13.230 --> 25:14.070
In fact, Baili Xiang

25:14.070 --> 25:15.390
is now the Commander of the War Division.

25:15.780 --> 25:17.400
Yuanzhong, the rest are all frightened.

25:17.430 --> 25:18.720
This is the perfect opportunity.

25:21.190 --> 25:21.990
Yuanzhong.

25:24.790 --> 25:25.590
Why?

25:26.590 --> 25:27.750
Why did she come?

25:29.350 --> 25:30.110
Perhaps she heard about

25:30.110 --> 25:31.290
what happened with the Council of Elders

25:31.310 --> 25:33.110
and came out of concern for you.

25:33.110 --> 25:33.870
What I meant is,

25:35.510 --> 25:36.190
why would she

25:36.190 --> 25:37.430
approach me?

25:38.870 --> 25:40.310
Don't you find it strange?

25:41.390 --> 25:43.310
Why would a highly skilled craftsman like her

25:44.590 --> 25:45.790
be willing to approach me

25:45.790 --> 25:47.630
to be my maid?

25:48.740 --> 25:50.470
I originally thought she had some ulterior motive.

25:51.950 --> 25:52.750
Perhaps,

25:54.390 --> 25:55.150
she was a spy

25:55.150 --> 25:56.510
sent by one of the elders,

25:57.150 --> 25:58.750
or a scout from the human race.

25:59.580 --> 26:00.580
Another possibility is that

26:00.990 --> 26:02.070
she held a grudge against me.

26:03.390 --> 26:04.910
Maybe someone in her clan

26:05.080 --> 26:06.250
had died in Pinghu,

26:07.630 --> 26:09.150
and she was raised since young to seek revenge.

26:10.710 --> 26:12.350
But she suddenly died like this,

26:20.910 --> 26:22.270
so suddenly.

26:24.590 --> 26:26.070
Don't you find it strange?

26:26.470 --> 26:27.160
What scheme could

26:27.160 --> 26:28.480
a dead person have?

26:30.590 --> 26:32.000
Could it be that she has an extraordinary identity,

26:33.150 --> 26:34.200
and the human race would use her death

26:34.200 --> 26:35.350
to stir up trouble?

26:35.830 --> 26:38.160
I've checked. Her background is clean.

26:38.710 --> 26:40.470
Then why did she die?

26:42.030 --> 26:42.910
This is suspicious.

26:43.310 --> 26:44.300
It doesn't make sense.

26:46.350 --> 26:47.990
How could she die so suddenly?

26:48.350 --> 26:49.160
Maybe,

26:49.830 --> 26:51.270
she genuinely liked you.

26:51.510 --> 26:52.470
Just as she said,

26:52.470 --> 26:53.790
she thought you were a good person

26:54.750 --> 26:57.310
and hoped you live a long and peaceful life.

27:00.870 --> 27:01.670
Impossible.

27:02.390 --> 27:03.510
Absolutely impossible.

27:03.910 --> 27:04.950
Anyway,

27:05.110 --> 27:06.830
the dead can't be brought back to life.

27:07.390 --> 27:08.640
We have ployed for so long,

27:08.640 --> 27:10.190
now is not the time to be distracted.

27:10.710 --> 27:11.510
Yuanzhong,

27:12.030 --> 27:13.430
you need to pull yourself together.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.190
Where's Dingxu?

27:17.710 --> 27:18.710
I haven't seen him.

27:20.700 --> 27:21.820
Then there's no rush yet.

27:42.220 --> 27:43.030
Grand Elder,

27:43.540 --> 27:44.350
here's the medicine.

27:58.310 --> 27:59.110
Grand Elder,

27:59.710 --> 28:01.110
what's really going on?

28:01.390 --> 28:02.760
Wasn't the possessing technique fake?

28:02.790 --> 28:03.740
Wasn't it all a trick

28:03.740 --> 28:04.470
by Tanghua and the others?

28:04.470 --> 28:05.670
They were acting this whole time?

28:05.990 --> 28:07.110
But how come you...

28:08.030 --> 28:09.110
This shouldn't be happening.

28:11.790 --> 28:15.230
Where are Xinyao and the other Elders?

28:15.820 --> 28:17.110
Those spineless cowards

28:17.110 --> 28:17.990
all went to the Liujiao Palace

28:17.990 --> 28:19.220
to kneel and beg the High Priest.

28:19.580 --> 28:21.510
They haven't been seen since.

28:25.590 --> 28:26.390
Grand Elder,

28:27.430 --> 28:29.110
the War Demons have returned,

28:29.670 --> 28:30.470
haven't they?

28:41.110 --> 28:42.310
What do we do with these things?

28:42.550 --> 28:43.340
They're useless now.

28:43.990 --> 28:44.790
Just burn them.

28:45.190 --> 28:46.390
What a shame to burn them.

28:46.710 --> 28:48.030
When I have time, I'll make a trip to Gushan

28:48.030 --> 28:48.670
and deliver these things

28:48.670 --> 28:50.030
to the old woman,

28:50.310 --> 28:52.070
so that she makes Dingxu experience the possesion every year.

28:52.070 --> 28:53.150
Make him suffer again.

28:53.950 --> 28:55.150
He might not live

28:55.390 --> 28:56.750
to experience another birthday.

28:56.940 --> 28:57.740
That's true.

29:16.020 --> 29:17.510
The sinner, Dingxu,

29:18.350 --> 29:21.070
have come to break the High Priest's seal.

29:21.170 --> 29:25.450
High Priest, please open the door and meet us.

29:44.070 --> 29:46.220
Greetings, High Priest.

29:47.830 --> 29:49.990
The War Demons have returned.

29:50.710 --> 29:53.270
We humbly request the High Priest to let go of past grievances

29:53.830 --> 29:55.430
for the greater good,

29:55.620 --> 29:57.310
and lead the entire clan to resist the War Demons,

29:58.190 --> 30:00.580
after the seal has been broken,

30:00.830 --> 30:03.240
to ensure our clan's heavenly fortune

30:04.070 --> 30:06.430
can be passed on immortally.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.310
Very well.

30:15.870 --> 30:18.460
Yuanzhong, I'm old now.

30:19.990 --> 30:21.670
I don't have many days left to live.

30:22.830 --> 30:24.230
From now on, Youhu Clan

30:25.390 --> 30:27.030
can only rely on you.

30:29.750 --> 30:30.550
Sure.

30:31.910 --> 30:32.720
Do...

30:34.710 --> 30:35.910
Do you have anything

30:36.770 --> 30:38.170
to say to me?

30:47.230 --> 30:48.030
Yuanzhong,

30:50.740 --> 30:53.230
I've watched you grow up after all.

30:53.750 --> 30:55.310
Everything I've done

30:57.070 --> 30:57.990
is all for

30:57.990 --> 30:59.790
our Youhu Clan.

31:01.440 --> 31:02.630
I suddenly remember

31:03.370 --> 31:04.860
that there's still something to ask.

31:06.750 --> 31:07.550
Go ahead.

31:08.830 --> 31:09.630
Ask it.

31:10.110 --> 31:11.190
Will you be removing

31:11.700 --> 31:13.060
the golden hoop today?

31:27.030 --> 31:27.820
Yes.

31:31.780 --> 31:32.830
Then let's begin.

31:34.630 --> 31:35.440
Alright.

33:28.710 --> 33:29.500
Everyone,

33:30.750 --> 33:31.870
it's been long.

33:42.630 --> 33:44.070
You've finally woken up.

33:48.100 --> 33:50.580
What... What happened to me?

33:51.020 --> 33:53.260
Your primordial spirit was summoned back by the Gate of Heaven

33:53.290 --> 33:54.410
and your divine power has been greatly weakened.

33:54.470 --> 33:55.550
If it weren't for Hannv

33:55.550 --> 33:57.190
casting healing spells on you

33:57.190 --> 33:58.680
to stabilize your primordial spirit,

33:58.870 --> 34:00.910
you would have lost

34:01.270 --> 34:02.990
a hundred years of cultivation.

34:03.880 --> 34:05.080
Thank you, Hannv.

34:05.550 --> 34:06.500
What happened?

34:08.699 --> 34:10.070
The situation

34:11.110 --> 34:12.270
was a bit complicated.

34:14.030 --> 34:15.230
Anyway, I just

34:15.870 --> 34:17.350
got beaten till death.

34:17.350 --> 34:18.870
You're a god, aren't you?

34:18.870 --> 34:20.630
You were beaten till death?

34:21.310 --> 34:22.909
The opponent was also very powerful.

34:23.230 --> 34:25.550
Besides, I'm just the God of Craftsmanship.

34:26.230 --> 34:27.230
My magic is on the average

34:27.310 --> 34:29.230
and my magical powers are limited in the mortal realm.

34:30.310 --> 34:32.429
Also, when I descended to the mortal realm,

34:32.630 --> 34:34.440
I went through the Sea of Flux.

34:34.590 --> 34:36.110
My physical body was severely damaged.

34:37.030 --> 34:37.960
Even now,

34:38.510 --> 34:40.389
it hasn't fully recovered yet.

34:40.540 --> 34:41.710
The High Priest of Youhu Clan

34:41.710 --> 34:42.630
doing?

34:44.030 --> 34:45.030
Hannv,

34:45.670 --> 34:47.389
you knew he would be in danger,

34:47.750 --> 34:49.030
so you intentionally summoned me back,

34:49.030 --> 34:49.840
didn't you?

34:50.590 --> 34:52.020
I have followers in the mortal realm.

34:52.110 --> 34:53.429
I vaguely know some things,

34:53.750 --> 34:54.550
but I'm not sure

34:54.550 --> 34:55.870
what exactly is happening.

34:56.440 --> 34:57.990
Whatever happens,

34:58.030 --> 34:59.470
it is his destiny.

34:59.830 --> 35:00.790
You are a god.

35:00.790 --> 35:02.140
You shouldn't be involved in it.

35:05.150 --> 35:06.540
I need to go back now.

35:08.990 --> 35:11.830
You think you just took a nap?

35:11.910 --> 35:14.110
Your primordial spirit was beaten out of your body.

35:14.390 --> 35:16.150
If you don't rest properly,

35:16.270 --> 35:18.070
your future cultivation will be affected.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.510
But my physical body

35:19.510 --> 35:20.590
is still down there.

35:20.590 --> 35:21.790
You have so many magical artifacts with you,

35:21.790 --> 35:22.790
you can just keep an eye on it.

35:22.830 --> 35:24.950
You can rush back if there's danger, it isn't too late.

35:45.100 --> 35:47.580
Peace, joy, and prosperity to all.

36:16.110 --> 36:16.910
What's wrong?

36:19.110 --> 36:19.840
Nothing.

36:19.840 --> 36:20.950
If it's nothing, why are you

36:20.950 --> 36:21.710
clutching your chest?

36:25.470 --> 36:26.910
My chest just feels a little tight.

36:26.990 --> 36:28.590
I've told you, your primordial spirit is damaged

36:28.590 --> 36:30.030
and needs proper rest.

36:30.430 --> 36:31.790
Why? You still want to go back?

36:31.950 --> 36:34.150
Stop wasting time, control you breath and stabilize your condition.

36:47.350 --> 36:48.150
Yuanzhong.

36:48.590 --> 36:49.470
Tanghua is here.

36:51.310 --> 36:52.350
Let's bury her.

37:06.140 --> 37:08.190
The view from my Liujiao Palace is nice, isn't it?

37:09.310 --> 37:11.190
I think you have never been here before.

37:12.030 --> 37:13.830
I came here the day Chiyi died.

37:15.670 --> 37:16.870
I had forgotten about that.

37:19.630 --> 37:21.030
Your seal has been broken?

37:21.310 --> 37:22.110
Yes.

37:22.750 --> 37:24.350
Regarding our plan for the possession,

37:25.230 --> 37:26.750
were you aware about it all along?

37:27.950 --> 37:28.750
I was.

37:28.990 --> 37:29.990
Then why did you...

37:34.070 --> 37:34.990
Did I what?

37:36.230 --> 37:37.310
Why did I not stop you?

37:38.510 --> 37:39.790
Weren't you trying to save me?

37:40.230 --> 37:41.830
How could I ruin your plan?

37:46.620 --> 37:47.430
Tanghua,

37:48.710 --> 37:50.350
why are you still like this?

37:50.830 --> 37:52.830
If you're going to do something, do it decisively.

37:53.190 --> 37:55.190
If you're going to take a side, do it thoroughly.

37:55.670 --> 37:57.150
If you're so hesitant

37:57.150 --> 37:58.430
and indecisive,

37:58.610 --> 38:00.230
how can you be the Commander of the War Division?

38:00.230 --> 38:01.550
I haven't taken any side.

38:01.950 --> 38:02.750
Back then, I did it for...

38:02.750 --> 38:03.480
A handmaiden from my Liujiao Palace

38:03.480 --> 38:05.030
has just died.

38:05.950 --> 38:07.710
My mood right now

38:07.710 --> 38:08.710
is very bad.

38:09.150 --> 38:10.500
Stop saying things

38:10.500 --> 38:12.390
that will make me unhappy,

38:17.820 --> 38:20.470
especially right now.

38:48.310 --> 38:49.950
What did you promise me back then?

38:50.590 --> 38:51.710
If it happens again,

38:52.150 --> 38:53.320
I will take your life.

38:53.760 --> 38:54.790
I am finding someone.

38:55.110 --> 38:56.470
I don't care who you're looking for.

38:57.310 --> 38:58.070
I advise that

38:58.070 --> 38:59.270
you give up this idea as soon as possible.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.870
My clan's whereabouts have been exposed.

39:03.550 --> 39:05.110
There might be a war soon.

39:05.550 --> 39:06.750
If you don't sharpen your skills,

39:06.900 --> 39:08.030
you'll end up dead sooner or later.

39:09.560 --> 39:10.560
I am looking for my mother.

39:11.550 --> 39:12.550
Her name is Su Niang.

39:12.910 --> 39:14.630
Someone said she lives in Gushan Town.

39:20.350 --> 39:21.920
You better take care of yourself first.

39:33.950 --> 39:34.870
You're leaving?

39:35.870 --> 39:37.030
There's no need to lie to me.

39:37.030 --> 39:37.670
When I passed by you room

39:37.670 --> 39:38.760
this morning,

39:38.760 --> 39:40.060
I saw you packing your bags.

39:42.470 --> 39:43.670
Even if I'm leaving,

39:43.870 --> 39:45.510
it isn't a big deal, is it?

39:45.870 --> 39:47.030
Of course it isn't for others,

39:47.430 --> 39:48.350
but I am happy for you

39:48.390 --> 39:49.790
that you're leaving.

39:51.430 --> 39:52.510
We've known each other for many years.

39:52.510 --> 39:53.780
Don't I know you well?

39:54.580 --> 39:56.030
We all consider Youhu Clan

39:56.030 --> 39:57.350
as a sacred place for cultivation,

39:57.950 --> 40:00.070
but you don't care at all.

40:01.070 --> 40:02.060
For you,

40:02.550 --> 40:04.150
this place feels more like a prison.

40:04.190 --> 40:06.270
It bounds you and took away your freedom.

40:06.790 --> 40:08.910
If you ask me, I think you should have left long ago.

40:09.870 --> 40:11.430
I've just figured out some things.

40:12.510 --> 40:13.830
If you're going to leave, do it now.

40:13.830 --> 40:14.790
Delay may bring changes.

40:15.030 --> 40:16.140
Can we go out now?

40:17.790 --> 40:18.870
The lockdown has been lifted.

40:19.030 --> 40:20.390
Everything is now back to normal.

40:21.340 --> 40:23.270
However, the defensive spells everywhere

40:23.270 --> 40:24.230
have not been deactivated.

40:24.710 --> 40:26.150
What exactly happened?

40:26.230 --> 40:28.190
We were confined here for days

40:28.190 --> 40:29.390
and weren't even allowed to leave our rooms.

40:29.870 --> 40:30.870
I don't know either

40:31.630 --> 40:33.030
and I advise you not to ask too much.

40:33.590 --> 40:34.790
The atmosphere has been off lately.

40:34.950 --> 40:36.390
The leaders from all mountains have gathered.

40:36.390 --> 40:37.070
Yesterday, they collectively

40:37.070 --> 40:38.430
went to the Liujiao Palace to kneel and worship.

40:38.990 --> 40:40.870
I guess someone must have made a mistake

40:40.870 --> 40:42.070
and angered the High Priest.

40:42.660 --> 40:44.180
How is Mr. Tanghua now?

40:45.030 --> 40:46.110
He has returned to the Jinxia Palace.

40:46.990 --> 40:47.610
Oh, right.

40:48.150 --> 40:49.950
I heard someone in the Liujiao Palace died.

40:50.910 --> 40:51.710
Who?

40:52.230 --> 40:53.430
A human-race handmaiden

40:53.430 --> 40:54.750
called Ji Tanyin.

41:02.510 --> 41:03.390
You're back.

41:05.150 --> 41:06.440
Where is Ji Tanyin buried?

41:07.110 --> 41:08.040
She's still in the room.

41:08.230 --> 41:09.750
Didn't I tell you to bury her properly?

41:09.910 --> 41:11.150
Why is she still in my room?

41:11.310 --> 41:12.230
Well, I was

41:12.230 --> 41:13.230
preparing the things

41:13.230 --> 41:14.550
to make it more dignified for her.

41:14.590 --> 41:15.350
It's been a whole day

41:15.350 --> 41:16.790
and you still haven't gotten this one task done?

41:18.470 --> 41:19.790
I haven't been doing nothing.

41:20.960 --> 41:21.840
What are these?

41:22.400 --> 41:23.510
These are all the burial goods

41:23.510 --> 41:24.750
prepared for Ji Tanyin.

41:25.710 --> 41:26.870
We have these in the Liujiao Palace?

41:27.190 --> 41:28.150
Is there anything in the whole Fangwai Mountain

41:28.150 --> 41:29.710
that I can't obtain if I want it?

41:30.320 --> 41:31.110
Yuanzhong,

41:32.110 --> 41:33.190
come with me, will you?

41:33.950 --> 41:35.450
Funerals of the human race are particular that

41:35.510 --> 41:36.830
the more people attending the funeral,

41:36.830 --> 41:37.910
the more dignified the deceased.

41:38.310 --> 41:39.230
If it's just me alone,

41:39.830 --> 41:41.470
she'll seem too pitiful.

42:30.630 --> 42:31.470
Which one should I choose?

42:34.950 --> 42:35.790
Which one should I choose?

42:38.350 --> 42:39.190
What do you mean?
